{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0068-s001", "text": "Patent- och registerstyrelsen, PRS, för register över bland annat företag, föreningar och stiftelser som är verksamma i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0068-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.35906982421875, "generation_seconds": 37.9572850971017, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0068-s002", "text": "PRS beviljar också patent och registrerar varumärken i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0068-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.30279541015625, "generation_seconds": 21.171775850933045, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0068-s003", "text": "Om en person vill bli företagare i Finland måste hen i vissa fall anmäla sig till handelsregistret, som upprätthålls av PRS.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0068-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.911836734693878, "peak": 0.3507080078125, "generation_seconds": 45.945657626958564, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0069-s001", "text": "En viktig uppgift för Utbildningsstyrelsen är att göra upp grunderna för läroplanen för olika skolstadier i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0069-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.031020408163265, "peak": 0.6351318359375, "generation_seconds": 35.68898313608952, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0069-s002", "text": "En person som flyttat till Finland ska kontakta Utbildningsstyrelsen om hen ansöker om erkännande av en utländsk examen i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0069-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.42421768707483, "peak": 0.334320068359375, "generation_seconds": 46.9881486359518, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0069-s003", "text": "Utbildningsstyrelsen ansvarar också för allmänna språkexamina, det vill säga YKI-test.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0069-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.385223388671875, "generation_seconds": 31.64826292800717, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0069-s004", "text": "Om en person ansöker om finskt medborgarskap kan hen visa sina språkkunskaper i finska eller svenska bland annat med ett YKI-test.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0069-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.702857142857143, "peak": 0.3690185546875, "generation_seconds": 40.5880857151933, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0069-s005", "text": "Testet är avgiftsbelagt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-myndigheter/narration/resume-20261103T073014184383+0000-6/hb-c12-u0069-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.786394557823129, "peak": 0.3043212890625, "generation_seconds": 9.718259915942326, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
